# Google Cloud / API Credentials
*.json
!public/top-10-music/*.json
!scripts/db/locked-editions.json
!tests/api/rag-golden-questions.json
# Baseline snapshot for the nightly RAG regression workflow. Must be
# committed so rag-golden-nightly can compare each run against a stable
# reference — without this, every CI run writes a throwaway baseline
# and drift is never detected.
!tests/api/rag-golden-baseline.json
# Pre-built offline weather archive — canonical dataset per CLAUDE.md's
# "Do Not Modify" list. Tests at tests/weather/ depend on this being
# available in CI, not just locally.
!public/data/weather/ohio/index/*.json

